# Abalone-U55 clang-tidy: minimal gate; JUCE wrapper best-effort (warnings recorded, not gating).
Checks: 'bugprone-*,modernize-use-override,readability-braces-around-statements'
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src/.*'
CheckOptions:
  - key: readability-braces-around-statements.ShortStatementLines
    value: 1
